{"version":1,"content":"<p>【效能狂飆 23 倍 ✅】Linux 核心創始人兼核心維護者 Linus Torvalds 改變對 AI 輔助編程 Vibe Coding 的態度，近日他提交了首個由 AI 輔助完成的 Linux 核心修正修補檔（Patch）。</p><p>根據他親自測試的結果，該修補檔最高帶來高達 23 倍的效能躍升。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T16:18:59.579175+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T16:07:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T07:17:31.821362+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T16:17:34.484046+00:00","content_hash":"3d8769b54744cb2b872e395475e50004d328fb47a28eacaa4a525d4e3c9b74c2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}